8. Neither this Agreement nor any right granted hereunder shall be assignable or otherwise transferable by You and that this Agreement may be modified or amended only in writing, signed by both parties;
9. The terms and conditions set forth in the Agreement shall survive the termination of Your relationship with The Open Group;
